  "prefLabel": "Plc 202.02 Appearance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 202.02 “Appearance” means a written notification to the OPLC or a board that a person or a person’s representative intends to actively participate in a proceeding.\n\nSource. #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200); ss by #14136, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.03)",
